[0.001, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m▸ What the AI wrote \u001b[2m(annotation cache.demo.example.org/diagnosis)\u001b[0m\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[33m"]
[0.027, "o", "    The cache is not Ready because cost center CC-4171 does not \r\n    exist. The most likely intended code is CC-4711, which \r\n    matches the application 'payments-api' and is owned by \r\n    'payments'.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[0m\r\n"]
